            "content": "<h4><strong>Experience the Power of Our Access Meeting Booth</strong></h4><p><br/>Elevate your workspace with the Access Meeting Booth, a perfect solution for meetings, calls, and focused work. These versatile <strong>working pods</strong> are designed to <strong>accommodate wheelchairs</strong>, offering a soundproof, accessible environment that boosts productivity. Whether for collaborative discussions or private conversations, our booths are customised to meet your unique needs. </p><p><br/>Don’t wait—take the next step towards a more productive workspace and discover the difference the Access Meeting Booth can make.</p>",
