    "faq_XB9pUr": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "question_WKqpGB": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I access the booth?",
            "text": "<p>The booth features a touchless sensor located on the left side of the frame for effortless access. Simply wave your hand in front of the sensor, and the door will open automatically—providing a seamless, hygienic, and user-friendly entry experience.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_JpcVqh": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is the booth easy to access with a wheel chair?",
            "text": "<p>Our agile acoustic DDA booths are floor level entry, allowing easy access for wheel chairs. Additionally the touch less entry button automatically opens the door for users.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_PnEPy3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What makes your accessibility booth suitable?",
            "text": "<p>Sustainability is a core aspect of the Access Booth's design. It incorporates recycled materials, with each booth containing approximately ≥180kg of recycled materials per 12m²/0.66m³. The booth also boasts a remarkably low carbon footprint of ≤0.071kg CO2e and minimal energy consumption of ≤0.4MJ, aligning with our commitment to eco-conscious design.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_XEewP7": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Power supply set up, do we need to do any thing?",
            "text": "<p>No. All our booths come with a 13amp power supply which plugs into the side of the booth with standard insert. Plug into your wall socket with locally supplied wall plug. If you are purchasing in UK, Europe or the US you will be supplied with local wall socket and correct electrical certificated components CE / UL Certificated.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_7AaHn8": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do the meeting and phone booths connect to power?",
            "text": "<p>Our meeting and phone booths require simple installation, we recommend using our professional installation team. Each booth features a built-in power inlet on the side with an integrated 13-amp fused spur. Once assembled, the included 2-metre cable simply plugs into a standard mains socket, making setup simple.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_aMninW": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is special electric power supply required?",
            "text": "<p>All of our meeting and phone booths are plug and play, meaning once built there is an insert for a 13amp cable on the side of the booth which approximately 2 metres long. This is the simply plugged into your normal power socket.<br/><br/>(UAE, UK / USA, Euro, Swiss supplied depending on the delivery address.)</p>"
          }
        }
      },
